  "_comment": "Integration registry: connections available to agents, and which agent gets which tools/model tier. Consumed by scripts/attach_integrations.py after create_agents.py has run. Connection auth material lives in Azure Key Vault / Foundry connections - never in this file. HUMAN APPROVAL POLICY (governance/HUMAN_APPROVAL.md): OpenAPI tools are attached READ-ONLY (non-GET operations stripped) unless a connection is listed in that agent's optional 'write_connections' array - the default for every agent is none; submissions of record happen only through the approval-gated workflows.",
